# Sulphur Vent's vent pools (CIPlay sulphur_vent_acid, 11-12 w16 prep; in a test world 'CI ...'). The diggers' path
# (-17 17 to -24 8) runs through pool A (acid zone sv_poolA at -20.5 12.5, r 1.8, safe=suit); its bypass bends by -25.6
# 16.5. The samplers' path (1 12 to 8 6) through pool B (sv_poolB at 4.5 9); its bypass by 8.7 13.9. Without a suit:
# through each pool hurt; round each by the bypass unhurt; a chest at each end.
# Offline-written, never run; re-read the offset after the build.
island Sulphur Vent keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm

empty
at -1 20.5 h=11.5
walk -1 20 to -2 16 h=10.3
walk -2 16 to -4 19.5 to -15 19.5 to -17 17
read DIGGINGS PATH
picture sv_poolA -16 +2.5 18 -20.5 +0 12.5
walk -17 17 to -19 14.5 to -20.5 12.5
wait 5
expect message vent pool
expect hurt 4
walk -20.5 12.5 to -17 17
wait 3
expect unhurt
walk -17 17 to -25.6 16.5 to -24 8
wait 3
expect unhurt
open Diggers' crate
wait 2
expect item MetalOre 2
walk -24 8 to -25.6 16.5 to -17 17 to -15 19.5 to -4 19.5 to -2 16 to 1 12
read SAMPLERS' PATH
picture sv_poolB 0 +2.5 13.5 4.5 +0 9
walk 1 12 to 4.5 9
wait 5
expect message vent pool
expect hurt 4
walk 4.5 9 to 1 12
wait 3
expect unhurt
walk 1 12 to 8.7 13.9 to 8 6
wait 3
expect unhurt
open Samplers' tin
wait 2
expect item CopperIngot 1
